      "id": "gh_0af7c9701b112ef4bbdd5444",
      "sourceId": "zapplyjobs/Internships-2026#121",
      "title": "Show your engineering momentum: a one-line badge for your README",
      "description": "Hi zapplyjobs team,\n\nWe run **VC Deal Flow Signal** ([gitdealflow.com](https://gitdealflow.com)), a free public dataset that tracks engineering momentum across GitHub orgs. zapplyjobs showed up in our panel this period with **992 commits in the last 14 days**.\n\nIf you'd like to show it on your README, here's a one-line badge (auto-updates weekly):\n\n```markdown\n[![engineering momentum](https://signals.gitdealflow.com/api/badge/zapplyjobs)](https://signals.gitdealflow.com/startup/zapplyjobs)\n```\n\nFree, no signup, no tracking. Nothing needed from you if you'd rather skip it. We track public activity regardless.\n\n— The Data Nerd · [signals@gitdealflow.com](mailto:signals@gitdealflow.com)",
