      "id": "gh_8b3a5938d24a091603c5280c",
      "sourceId": "zapplyjobs/Internships-2026#119",
      "title": "Canada-specific science internship/job resource suggestion",
      "description": "Hi! I noticed this repo's North America section has a small Canada subsection, and MITACS Globalink is currently marked as no longer available.\n\nWould you consider adding Hanzilla Jobs as a Canada-specific companion resource for undergrads looking for research-adjacent internships/co-ops and early-career science roles?\n\nSuggested Markdown:\n\n```md\n  * [Hanzilla Jobs - Canadian science internships and student roles](https://jobs.hanzilla.co/sciences/internships/) - free daily-updated board for Canadian students/recent grads searching science, research, lab, data, environmental, engineering, internship/co-op, new-grad, junior, and entry-level roles. About/verification: https://jobs.hanzilla.co/about/\n```\n\nWhy it may fit:\n\n- The repo is explicitly useful for undergraduates looking for research internships.\n- Hanzilla's sciences page is Canada-focused and includes research/lab/science/data/environmental-adjacent student roles, not only software.\n- The site is free, daily-updated, and has a public about/verification page: https://jobs.hanzilla.co/about/\n\nDisclosure: I help operate Hanzilla Jobs. Totally okay if this is too job-board-like for the list; sharing because the Canada section is sparse and one listed Canada program is no longer available.",
